	(text "TX notes\n- FIX: CC2595 RF_OUT (pins 10/12) is the PA collector and needs a DC feed: 12 nH\n  from VDD_PA as on the TI CC2595EM. It was missing from the Altium drawing.\n- FIX: RBIAS1/RBIAS2 20k go to VDD_PA per the TI EM schematic (the drawing tied\n  them to GND). The TI BOM table conflicts with this; confirm on first boards.\n- GND on every CC2595 GND pin and the EP (TODO \"add GND connection to PA\").\n- TX antenna: Taoglas FXP70.07.0053A flex antenna on a U.FL at the right edge (53 mm cable).\n- PA input pad: the LMX2582 gives several dBm; 3 dB pad plus OUTA_PWR register\n  sets ~0 dBm into the PA (abs max +10 dBm)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 300 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "ad4cd7e3-f03e-5fd9-b553-4dcbd0c127b1"))
